Apache Atlas Semantic Indexer
=============================

Standalone Kafka consumer that listens on `ATLAS_ENTITIES`, builds embeddable text
from JanusGraph, and partial-updates the JanusGraph OpenSearch vertex index with
semantic embeddings via the `atlas-semantic-ingest` ML pipeline.

Run after Atlas and OpenSearch ML model deployment:

  atlas_semantic_indexer.sh

Configuration (atlas-application.properties):

  atlas.search.semantic.opensearch.model.id
  atlas.search.semantic.opensearch.embedding.dimension
  atlas.semantic.indexer.kafka.group.id
  atlas.semantic.indexer.batch.size
